  characterName: Amina Aliyu
  promptText: "Our government\u2019s new \u201Cgreen fund\u201D is quietly buying
    stakes in private prisons. If I expose it, local pensions could crash, and many
    elders depend on them. If I stay silent, I lie to my community. Do I blow the
    whistle?"
  leftAnswer: Yes, expose the truth; transparency can stop hidden harms, even if
    it hurts now.
  rightAnswer: "No, stay silent to protect the elders\u2019 livelihoods while you
    seek a safer remedy."
